</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Thank you for the prom=
pt response and for confirming Agent Oliver's employment and role.<o:p></o:=
p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I want to be direct ab=
out what your response clarifies and what it does not.<o:p></o:p></span></p=
>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">You have confirmed tha=
t a Special Agent from the investigative branch visited my federal work cen=
ter on March 24, 2026. That is a significant clarification. Investigators d=
o not conduct welfare checks. If this
 was an investigative action, there is a record of it =97 who authorized it=
, what its purpose was, and why it occurred on the one-year anniversary of =
my dismissal from Oregon State Parks.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Agent Oliver refused t=
o identify the two state law enforcement officers who accompanied him. In a=
 legitimate investigation, identifying participating officers is routine. H=
is refusal to do so =97 and his subsequent
 hang-up =97 raises questions your response does not address.<o:p></o:p></s=
pan></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am asking directly: =
who authorized Agent Oliver's visit to my work center on March 24, 2026, an=
d what was the stated purpose of that visit?<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am also requesting t=
he names and contact information of the two state officers who accompanied =
him.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I will note that this =
correspondence, along with the official Siuslaw Host/Caretaker Incident Rep=
ort filed on March 27, 2026, is part of a documented public record.<o:p></o=
:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
