<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">To Whom It Concerns:</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am a volunteer caretaker for the Siuslaw=
 National Forest, Oregon Dunes National Recreation Area, Siltcoos Corridor.=
</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">On March 24, 2026, an individual identifyi=
ng himself as Matt Oliver, badge number 555, stationed in Springfield, arri=
ved at the Siltcoos Work Center =97 a restricted federal facility =97 along=
 with two other officers. He did not coordinate
 with the local Siuslaw Forest Service law enforcement officer prior to thi=
s visit. He was here to intimidate me over a protected First Amendment righ=
t.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">I have filed an official Siuslaw National =
Forest Host/Caretaker Incident Report documenting this visit.</span><o:p></=
o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am writing to confirm whether a Matt Oli=
ver is employed by your office and to obtain the contact information of his=
 supervisor so that I may properly document this incident through appropria=
te channels.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">Thank you for your assistance.</span><o:p>=
</o:p></p>
<p><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
